    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to 46 Belarmine Place, an immaculately presented three-bedroom duplex home, well nestled in the immensely popular Belarmine development in Stepaside.\n\nExtending to approximately 122sq.m (1,315sq.ft), this excellent family home is laid out over two levels and boasts an ideal balance between comfortable living space and generous bedroom accommodation. Benefitting from an excellent B2 BER rating, prospective buyers can expect low energy bills and a 'green mortgage' offering available to them.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a warm and inviting entrance hallway with a high ceiling, featuring a convenient storage space to the right before leading to a stylish guest WC, initial door to left brings you into a stunning and light-filled living room with a front aspect and feature fireplace, with double doors connecting seamlessly to a fine and modern open plan kitchen/dining room, benefitting from a separate utility room and with French doors leading onto a private rear garden with patio space and a picturesque, raised bed Rose garden enclosed by railway sleepers along the left wall. A tiled green shed at the foot of the garden completes what is the perfect space for outdoor dining and entertaining guests. To the front of the property there is parking for residents in addition to an abundance of visitor parking. \n\nOn the first floor are two generously-proportioned double bedrooms, the main bedroom featuring a private en-suite, fitted floor-to-ceiling wardrobes and a triple-box window with front aspect. A smaller bedroom to the rear and a contemporary family bathroom two-tile walls complete the excellent accommodation this modern home has to offer.\n\nPositioned just off the Enniskerry Road within short walking distance to both Stepaside and Sandyford Villages, 46 Belarmine Place has a vast amount of nearby amenities to avail of including supermarkets, cafes, restaurants and bars. Belarmine Plaza is includes a number of these itself and is part of the development so a stroll from your doorstep. Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Village, Carrickmines Retail Park, Leopardstown Shopping Centre and Beacon South Quarter are also close by.\n\nRecreational amenities are plentiful with the excellent, 34-hectare Fernhill Park right on your doorstep and the Dublin Mountains in proximity. There are also several golf courses, rugby, football and tennis clubs within the vicinity to enjoy.\n\nLocal schools include Stepaside Educate Together National Primary & Secondary Schools, Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille, St. Mary's Woodside National School and Rosemount Secondary School to name a few.\n\nThe property also benefits from excellent transport links with the nearby LUAS Green line and Dublin Bus offering several frequent routes. Direct access to the M50 motorway ensures easy travelling to and from Dublin City Centre in addition to other primary national roads such as the N11.\n\n\nThis modern, impeccably kept home will appeal to those seeking to live in a vibrant and family-friendly community and viewing is highly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith semi-solid wood flooring, door to storage space, door to living room, door to kitchen/dining, radiator, alarm\n\nLiving Room - \nFront aspect, grey carpet, sage walls, fitted shelving and cabonets, feature fireplace, radiator, Triple box windows, French doors leading to:\n\nKitchen Dining Room - \nOpen plan, tiled flooring, French doors leading to garden, modern kitchen with Gas cooker, cream fitted presses, extractor fan, stainless steel sink with window above, radiator, door to utility room\n\nGuest WC - \nTiled flooring, feature wallpaper, wc, whb, radiator\n\nBedroom 1 - \nFront aspect, grey carpet, triple box windows, fitted floor-to-ceiling wardrobes, en-suite\n\nEn-Suite - \nTiled flooring, wc, whb, shower\n\nBedroom 2 - \nRear aspect, grey carpet, fitted floor-to-ceiling wardrobes, radiator\n\nBedroom 3 - \nRear aspect, grey carpet, radiator, fitted floor-to-ceiling wardrobes\n\nBathroom - \nTiled flooring, wc, whb, shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Modern 122sq.m three bedroom duplex that has been impeccably maintained by its current owner</li><li></li><li>Turn-key condition</li><li></li><li>B2 BER</li><li></li><li>Gas-fired central heating</li><li></li><li>Alarm</li><li></li><li>Picturesque, landscaped rear garden with private aspect and raised Rose bed with railway sleepers</li><li></li><li>Stepaside Educate Together & Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille on your doorstep</li><li></li><li>Excellent transport links via Glencairn Luas, Dublin Bus & M50/N11</ul>"
      },
